  "title": "On local solutions of the Ramanujan equation and their connection formulae",
  "authors_raw": "Takeshi MORITA\u2217",
  "title_lines": [
   "On local solutions of the Ramanujan equation",
   "and their connection formulae"
  ],
  "abstract": "We show connection formulae of local solutions of the Ramanujan equation between the origin and the in\ufb01nity. These solutions are given by the Ramanujan function, the q-Airy function and the divergent basic hypergeometric series 2\u03d50(0, 0; \u2212; q, x). We use two di\ufb00erent q- Borel-Laplace transformations to obtain our connection formulae.",
